WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.950
Guile approaches crouching Terry with raw Drive Rush.

2
00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:01.650
Standing heavy kick hits the crouching target.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.150
Standing medium punch links after the Rush heavy kick.

4
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.650
Crouching medium punch continues the confirm.

5
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.350
Perfect light Sonic Boom connects after the medium punches.

6
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:04.950
Standing heavy kick connects after the Boom.

7
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.250
Heavy Sonic Hurricane finishes the confirm.

8
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.050
Terry lands at the final midscreen spacing.
